# SymbiYosys work directories. `sby -f formal/mac_array.sby small` creates
# formal/mac_array_small/ (plus a stray base dir per task) holding elaborated
# netlists, model scripts, engine logs and VCD counterexamples -- about 4.6 MB
# of pure build output next to the 8 KB of sources that generated it. None of
# it belongs in history; regenerate with `make formal`.
formal/mac_array*/
!formal/mac_array.sby
!formal/mac_array_props.sv
